      *****************************************************************
001100*      INQUIRY OF ALL THE PURCHASE ORDERS & RECEIVING SLIPS
001200*        PER CORPORATE CODE.  THE FOLLOWING FIELDS ARE SHOWN:
001300*        CODE, KEYWORD-ADJECTIVE, ORDERED AMOUNT, UM, RECEIVED
001400*        AMOUNT, RECEIVED DATE, STORED AMOUNT, STORED DATE,
001500*        TOTAL ONORDER.
      *****************************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C   03/19/93   BK DISMUKES   REQUEST # 6061
      *C      1. ADDED LOGIC TO INQUIRE HISTORY DATABASE.  WILL RUN
      *C         FROM "F6" KEY.
      *C
      *C   06/10/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C      EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C      SUBTRACT 19M/20M FROM THE BINARY FIELDS BEFORE REFORMATING
      *C      FOR DISPLAY USING TDATECHK.
      *C
      *C   12/19/96   JEFF BUNGO  96-044
      *C      ALLOW PO INQUIRY AND RCV SLIP INQUIRY FROM Q4 INQUIRY BY
      *C      ENTERING CHARACTER NEXT TO PO OR RCVR NUMBER.
      *C
      *C   01/10/97   JEFF BUNGO  96-044
      *C      ALLOW USER TO SELECT SORT SEQUENCE OF PO BY PO DATE
      *C      ASCENDING OR DESCENDING ORDER.  THE USER WILL CHOOSE
      *C      THE SORT ON THE ENTRY SCREEN, "A" FOR ASCENDING OR
      *C      "D" FOR DESCENDING, " " INDICATES NO SORT BY PO DATE
      *C      AND ONLY SORT BY PO NUMBER.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSINVPOI  CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      *****************************************************************

