007300*------ THE TEMP PO AREA IS USED TO SKIP A LINE BETWEEN GROUPS OF
007400*------ PO/RCVRS WITH THE SAME PO NUMBER ON THE SCREEN.  NOTE THAT FOR
007500*------ THIS PURPOSE THE PO/RELEASE IS CONSIDERED THE P.O. NUMBER, SIN
007600*------ WE WANT TO SKIP A LINE BETWEEN DIFFERENT RELEASES OF THE PO.
007700 01  TEMP-PO-RCV-NO.
007800     10     FILLER                 PIC X(1).
007900     10  TEMP-PO                   PIC X(10).
008000     10     FILLER                 PIC X(3).
008100
007700 01  TEMP-POH-RCV-NO.
007900     10  TEMP-POH                  PIC X(10).
008000     10     FILLER                 PIC X(3).
007800     10     FILLER                 PIC X(1).
008100
