       01  TEMP-PO-DATE                  PIC X(8).
008300
008400*------ IN THIS TABLE, ALL RECEIVERS AND ACCUMULATOR VALUES
008500*------ ARE LOADED IN FOR THE CORPORATE CODE BEING INQUIRED UPON.
008600*------ NOTE! THIS TABLE MUST BE BIGGER THAN TABLE MAX OR YOU
008700*------ WILL GET 'UNPREDICTABLE RESULTS'
      *-970110----ADDED PO DATE TO TABLE FOR SORTING BY DATE IN
      *-----------THE BUBBLE SORT.
008800 01  SAVE-PO-RCV-NO-TABLE.
008900     05  SAVE-LINE OCCURS 2002 TIMES.
009000         10  SAVE-PO-RCV-NO.
009100             15     FILLER         PIC X(1).
009200             15  SAVE-PO           PIC X(10).
009300             15     FILLER         PIC X(3).
009000         10  SAVE-POH-RCV-NO  REDEFINES SAVE-PO-RCV-NO.
009200             15  SAVE-POH          PIC X(10).
009300             15     FILLER         PIC X(3).
009100             15     FILLER         PIC X(1).
009400         10  SAVE-ITEM-NO          PIC X(4).
               10  SAVE-PO-DATE          PIC X(8).

       01  SAVE-SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  SAVE-IND OCCURS 99 TIMES PIC 1.

