075300 7500-SPACE-OUT-ZDEC.
075400*------ THE FOLLOWING ROUTINE SPACES OUT ANY DECIMAL QTY OF ZERO ON
075500*------ THE SCREEN.  SO IF A QTY WAS "250.0000" IT WOULD SHOW UP AS
075600*------ "250".
075700     IF S-ORD-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB) = ".0000"
075800         MOVE SPACES TO S-ORD-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB).
075900     IF S-DLV-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB) = ".0000"
076000         MOVE SPACES TO S-DLV-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB).
076100     IF S-STR-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB) = ".0000"
076200         MOVE SPACES TO S-STR-QTY-DEC (SCREEN-SUB).
077200
077300 9-USER-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER), IND (99).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                   SCREEN-MESSAGE-LINE.
077900 9-USER-ERROR-X.
078000     EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

078200 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
079200 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
079300     EXIT.
